commit b5261a71a25c318bb00770b87f78fa4d82d83637
Author: KonomiTV local mods <local@konomi.tv>
Date:   Fri Nov 13 08:21:10 2026 +0900

    feat(client): recorder-style seek controls for recorded playback
    
    - Add SeekControlManager (Video mode only): skip buttons flanking the play
      button (-30s / -10s / +10s / +30s; inner pair uses configurable seconds)
    - Rapid taps are coalesced into a single seek; seeks clamp to the
      seekable range
    - Long-press (480ms+) starts 8x fast seek (seek stepping, muted),
      released to stop; works as continuous seek for TV remotes too
    - Persist recorded-playback speed (0.75-2.0) in local settings and
      restore it on next playback; live playback always starts at 1.0x
    - Plain ArrowLeft/ArrowRight in Video mode now seek by the configured
      seconds (default -10s/+30s); Ctrl/Shift/Alt variants unchanged
    - Skip buttons are focusable and Enter/Space operable (Android TV)
    - New local-only settings: video_seek_backward_seconds,
      video_seek_forward_seconds, video_playback_rate (not server-synced)

